<report>
<line>System;<title>Wilcoxon's signed ranks test</title></line>
<line></line>
<line><in>sample_1</in> vs. <in>sample_2</in></line>
<line>Number of non-zero differences ranked = <in>non_0</in></line>
<line><in>sum</in></line>
<line></line>
<line><in>stats</in></line>
<line><pval>Lower side <inp>p_l</inp></pval>  (H<sub>1</sub>: differences tend to be less than zero)</line>
<line><pval>Upper side <inp>p_u</inp></pval>  (H<sub>1</sub>: differences tend to be greater than zero)</line>
<line><pval>Two sided <inp>p_2</inp></pval>  (H<sub>1</sub>: differences tend not to be zero)</line>
<block name="noconf">
<line></line>
<line>confidence interval not calculated if n &lt; 4</line>
</block>
<block name="conf">
<line></line>
<line><ci><in>pc</in></ci></line>
<line>Median difference = <in>med_diff</in> (<ci><in>from</in> to <in>to</in></ci>)</line>
</block>
</report>
